{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":11817965,"ns":0,"title":"Air permeability specific surface","extract":"The air permeability specific surface of a powder material is a single-parameter measurement of the fineness of the powder.  The specific surface is derived from the resistance to flow of air (or some other gas) through a porous bed of the powder.","description":"Powder fineness indicator","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}